msgid_plural "{count} glass panes at 0x98, each outlined at its owner group's bone while Collision is on."
msgstr[0] "{count} Glasscheibe bei 0x98, am Knochen ihrer Besitzergruppe umrandet, solange „Kollision“ an ist."
